# Never Spin Up Localhost

Never start a dev server, production server, or anything that listens on localhost in this project. The user always does runtime and browser testing themselves.

Do not run:
- `npm run dev`, `npm start`, `next dev`, `next start`, `npx next ...` servers
- `prisma studio`, `stripe listen`, or any other local server or tunnel
- `curl`/`fetch` against `localhost` or `127.0.0.1`
- Browser automation against local URLs

Allowed checks: `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, `npm ls`, `npm audit`, and reading the code.

When a change needs runtime verification, finish the static checks, then tell the user what to test (which pages or flows) and let them run it.
